         <!--[bene]merenti qụ[i vixit annos - - -] / [menses - - -]II et dies VII[- - -] / ((piscis)) ((monogramma Christi in crucem translatum cum alpha et omega in corona taeniata)) / [- - - i]n pace d(eposit- - -) VIIII  id[us - - -] / [Arc]adio II et Rufino v(iro) c(larissimo) c[ons(ulibu)s - - -] --><div type="edition" xml:lang="la"><head>Text</head><ab><lb n="1"/><supplied reason="lost">bene</supplied>merenti qụ<supplied reason="lost">i vixit annos <gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/></supplied><lb n="2"/><supplied reason="lost">menses</supplied><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/>II et dies VII<gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/><lb n="3"/><g type="descriptive">piscis</g> ((monogramma Christi in crucem translatum cum alpha et omega in corona taeniata))<lb n="4"/><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/><supplied reason="lost">i</supplied>n pace d(eposit---) VIIII  id<supplied reason="lost">us</supplied><gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/><lb n="5"/><supplied reason="lost">Arc</supplied>adio II et Rufino <expan><abbr>v</abbr><ex>iro</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>c</abbr><ex>larissimo</ex></expan> c<supplied reason="lost"><expan><abbr>ons</abbr><ex>ulibu</ex>s</expan> <gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/></supplied> </ab></div>
         <div type="apparatus">
            <p>According to Ferrua 1986, ad loc. cit. 5. [Pall]ADIO, Silvagni in ICVR ad loc. cit.; the consuls of the year 392 were the emperor Arcadius and Fl. Rufinus.  Iunius Quartus Palladius was consul in 416, together with the emperor Theodosius: see A. Degrassi 1952, about year 416. </p>
         </div>
